					}
				},
				{
					type: "text",
					content: "The modern commerce center and urban playground, the Metro Kingdom is a vast and bustling web of cities and skyscrapers. Its most famous location, New Donk City, is the home of the famous rivalry between Mario and Donkey Kong; now governed by Mayor Pauline. It is constantly under construction, with the iconic red girders scaling every street! ",
					alignContent: "left",
				},
				{
