							caption: "Wrecking Crew"
						},
						{
							image: "mario_arcade.png",
							caption: "Mario Bros."
						},
					]
				},
				{
					type: "horizontal-rule",
				},
				{
					type: "text",
					title: "New Donk City",
					content: "The City that never Leaps! This is the urban center, notarized by the New Donk City Hall - the tallest skyscraper in the city. This is a hub of tourism with the original Crazy Cap store, its musical culture and the wondrous festival and accompanying lightshow. The city is powered with an underground power plant below the city, using the energy of moons. Here are some of the various streets and attractions in New Donk City:",
					alignContent: "left",
				},
				{
					type: "list",
